                            {
                                "id": "0,0,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": "To take the derivative of a function symbolically, use the appropriate buttons from the Mathematical analysis panel. The system automatically applies differentiation rules to all functions and operations in the expression. The result is given in symbolic form and can be used for further calculations or substitutions.",
